    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. The cabin is a simplified shell without a full dashboard.. Panel gaps, glazing, lamp lenses, wheel arches and the underside floorpan are all modelled, and the top and bottom views confirm a closed body with no missing faces. No brand badge, wordmark or number plate appears anywhere.",
